    {
      "target": "초록 불은 작동 중임을 표시해요.",
      "reading": "Chorok bureun jakdong jungimeul pyosihayo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The green light indicates that it is running.",
        "ko": "초록 불은 작동 중임을 표시해요.",
        "ipa": "Chorok bureun jakdong jungimeul pyosihayo.",
        "ar": "الضوء الأخضر يدل على أنه يعمل.",
        "cs": "Zelené světlo signalizuje, že je v provozu.",
        "da": "Det grønne lys viser, at den kører.",
        "de": "Das grüne Licht zeigt an, dass es läuft.",
